{"product":{"id":9483685757216,"title":"Terreno T50 Mixed Gravel Endurance","body_html":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpeed and capability from hardpack to mixed terrain\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Terreno T50 Mixed Gravel Endurance tire delivers the ideal balance of speed, control, and off-road capability across hardpack and mixed terrain. With a T-score of 50, it sits between two established gravel favorites: the T30, formerly known as Terreno Dry, and the T70, formerly known as Mezcal. Its versatile tread combines directional siping, stable cornering lugs, and an efficient center profile for confident performance on pavement, packed dirt, and moderately loose gravel.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBuilt with Vittoria’s Endurance Formulation powered by Graphene, the T50 is designed for dependable performance over long distances and changing weather conditions. An anti-puncture belt and reinforced sidewall protection enhance durability, stability, and puncture resistance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor riders who want one tire for a wide range of gravel conditions, the T50 is a true set-it-and-forget-it solution—fast enough for smooth roads, capable enough when the terrain gets rougher.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c!----\u003e","vendor":"Vittoria","product_type":"Gravel Tire","created_at":"2024-06-14T09:25:11-05:00","handle":"terreno-t50-tubeless-ready","updated_at":"2026-10-13T08:36:13-05:00","published_at":"2024-06-21T16:01:38-05:00","template_suffix":"terreno-t50","published_scope":"global","tags":"Discounted products, EP70, Gravel, Gravel Endurance, IPP40, Sitewide, Tires","variants":[{"id":48827996307744,"product_id":9483685757216,"title":"700x40c \/ Brown","price":"81.99","sku":"11A00610","position":1,"compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"700x40c","option2":"Brown","option3":null,"created_at":"2024-06-19T14:32:32-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-13T08:36:13-05:00","taxable":true,"barco